# FILEEDIT.LNK -- on the SBC:  LINK99 @FILEEDIT.LNK
# The same arguments fileedit\make_SBC_FileEdit99.ps1 gives the Windows
# link99, with the map renamed FEMAP.TXT.  OVL_NAMEIO and OVL_PASTE keep
# their long names here and in the map; the SBC opens them as the 8.3
# files OVL_NAME.R99 and OVL_PAST.R99.
-O1000 -S -YFEMAP.TXT FILEEDIT.EXE
FILESTAT.R99 FILEIO.R99 FILEDATA.R99 TERMIO.R99 CONRX.R99 EBMAP.R99
EDITBUF.R99 VIEWCTL.R99 EDITCTL.R99 EDITMENU.R99 OVLMGR.R99 OVCALL.R99
CALL.R99 IOCORE.R99 IOOPEN.R99 IOREAD.R99 IOWRITE.R99 CBDOS.R99
OVL_WORD.R99 OVL_CHAR.R99 OVL_RPT.R99 OVL_VIEW.R99 OVL_EDIT.R99
OVL_PASTE.R99 OVL_NAMEIO.R99
CLIB99.LIB
